# 🇨🇦 Yukon — The Ultimate Travel Guide

## Welcome to Yukon

Yukon is Canada's land of wilderness, mountains, rivers, and legendary adventure.

Located in Canada's northwest, Yukon is one of the world's greatest destinations for travelers seeking untouched nature, incredible wildlife, Indigenous cultures, and experiences far away from crowds.

Home to Canada's highest mountain, some of the largest protected wilderness areas on Earth, and some of the best northern lights viewing anywhere, Yukon offers a travel experience unlike any other.

This is a place where glaciers shape valleys, rivers cut through mountains, wildlife moves freely, and the sky comes alive with colour.

Yukon is where adventure begins.

